{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenges contain two images composed of eyes: one defined on the right and one interactive on the left. In the center, a series of rules will change the color and shape of the eyes in the left image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to compose the left image so that it is identical to the right one once the changes are applied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also another option where both images are defined, and it's up to you to create the change rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred challenges to solve across 10 difficulty levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere (or not if you're trypophobic!)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ORANGE 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/ef40a9a055046e3581d15264dfe8e9cec0dc9914.jpg"},{"name":"ORANGE 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/db97f6773f214de228fd1b8cb0758bb80ec0e05e.jpg"},{"name":"ORANGE 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/a8b77763c88c57149ad8dd27b04bf17c65800cbf.jpg"},{"name":"ORANGE 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/4dc051c26efc4c21a8419dbe309c9e2550382784.jpg"},{"name":"ORANGE 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/0c560764b84169b26f90919d22fc7bf534299558.jpg"},{"name":"BLUE 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/844e6b889934ecb3d5d7f4279fb8c8a13f6cca38.jpg"},{"name":"BLUE 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119120/6940eddc5d7673d55a5e63acae474e22931dd839.jpg"},{"name":"BLUE 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai